{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <div class=\"no-overflow\"><strong style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\">&nbsp;<div class=\"mediaplugin mediaplugin_videojs d-block\"><div style=\"max-width:640px;\"><\/div><\/div>&nbsp;<br>3\uff0e\u301c\u306e\u3067\u3001\u301c<\/strong><br>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n    <table border=\"1\">\r\n        <colgroup>\r\n            <col width=\"525\">\r\n        <\/colgroup>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n                            <p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u3088\u3046\u3058\u304c\u3042\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3001\u306f\u3084\u304f\u5e30\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p dir=\"ltr\">(V\u00ec c\u00f3 vi\u1ec7c b\u1eadn n\u00ean t\u00f4i v\u1ec1 s\u1edbm.)<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n                            <p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">\u5206\u304b\u3089\u306a\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3001\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002<\/p>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;(V\u00ec t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3u n\u00ean h\u00e3y ch\u1ec9 cho t\u00f4i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng.)<\/p>\r\n                <\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table><strong style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\"><br><\/strong>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem; text-transform: inherit;\"><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong><\/span><\/div>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/strong>D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ec3u hi\u1ec7n bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1ch quan quan h\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n q